8,"Emberá, Northern Language (EMP) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/emp/,"Northern Emberá is a stable indigenous language of Panama and Colombia. It belongs to the Chocoan language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.","Emberá, Northern",Chocoan
